SUMMARY:Decoda Chamber Music Festival Artists in Concert
DESCRIPTION:The Decoda Chamber Music Festival (DCMF) returns to the Asheville area for its 12th season. This unique summer festival is dedicated to training the next generation of artists to rethink and reimagine their role in society. Through exceptional chamber music making and creative collaborations\, the Decoda Chamber Music Festival empowers promising young musicians to explore how music can build and strengthen community and their own artistic practice—working closely alongside Decoda’s professional artists every step of the way. \nCome celebrate with our 2026 Festival Artists in an evening of music. \nFree and open to the public.  \nDonations are welcome and all donations support the Festival and student scholarships.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/decoda-chamber-music-festival-artists-in-concert-2/
LOCATION:Warren Wilson Presbyterian Church
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
END:VEVENT
