SUMMARY:Jerry’s Dead Thursdays
DESCRIPTION:Jerry’s Dead from Asheville is a fast growing\, fan favorite\, tribute to the music of Jerry Garcia. Members include Lee Kram on drums and vocals\, Gus Vigo on keys and vocals\, Dan Pederson on bass and vocals and features Tim Marsh on guitar and lead vocals. Drawing from over a hundred and fifty songs from The Grateful Dead and Jerry Garcia Band catalog\, this quartet delivers with fervor and improvisational spirit intact. \nFrench Broad River Brewery is more than just a place to enjoy a drink—it’s a community hub where great beer\, delicious pizza\, live music\, and good times come together. Just minutes from the Biltmore Estate & Downtown\, our taproom is a gathering spot for locals and visitors alike. We regularly host live music and entertainment in our taproom\, making French Broad River Brewery a lively hub of local activity. From bluegrass to reggae\, there’s always something happening. Check out our Events Page to see what’s coming up next! \nNo brewery experience is complete without great food. That’s why we offer French Broad River Pizza\, serving up hot\, hand-tossed pizzas made to order. Whether you’re here for a quick slice or a full meal\, our pizza perfectly complements our craft beers and the lively atmosphere of our taproom. frenchbroadbrewery.com/pizza \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jerrys-dead-2-2-2-2-2-2/2026-06-25/
LOCATION:French Broad River Brewery\, 101 Fairview Rd\, Asheville\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
