SUMMARY:Thursday Open Mics / Jams
DESCRIPTION:Although we are primarily a Live Music Calendar\, we also try to keep track of open mics and jams events in the area and list them for you as we find out about them. As things may change without our knowledge\, please verify the with the venue before heading out. \nBluegrass Jam @ Zuma Coffee Marshall – 6-8pm (first & third Thursdays) \nTrue Home Open Mic Night @Flood Gallery Fine Art Center (new location) 6-8:30pm \nBlunt Pretzels Swannanoa – 6-9pm \n \nGarden Creek Foundation Community Barn Jam – 6-9pm (Third Thursdays) \nOld Time or Irish Session @Leveller Brewing Co Weaverville – 6-9pm (Old Time 1st & 3rd Thursdays\, Irish Session 2nd & 4th Thursdays) \nHi Wire South Slope – 6-9pm \nColton Gallery River Arts – 6-9pm (May 23) \nWheelhouse South Slope – 7-10pm (exclude April 23) \nPlant Bar South Slope – 7-9pm (1st & 3rd Thursdays) \nBens Tune Up – 8-11pm (open mic/decks) \n  \n  \n 
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/thursday-open-mics-jams-2/2026-06-25/
LOCATION:Asheville Area
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,DJ/Electronic,Open MIc/Jam
